.marketing
  section.feature-section(aria-labelledby="privacy-title")
    .container.section-intro
      p.marketing-kicker Orbit · illustrative product content
      h1#privacy-title= saas.legal.privacyTitle
      p= saas.legal.notice
      h2 Information entered in this demo
      p Sign-in and account setup controls are disabled. The pricing interaction updates sample prices in your browser, and the newsletter example displays a local demo response. No personal information is sent or stored by these pages.
      h2 Product concept
      p A real Orbit service would need a specific privacy notice covering its operator, purposes, processors, retention periods, user rights, and contact details. This repository does not supply those production details.
      h2 Learn more
      p
        a.marketing-text-link(href=route('saas.terms')) Read the terms overview #[span(aria-hidden="true") →]
